###Dataset Name: Hot Dog Survey Spring 2025
###Description: A survey collecting opinions about whether a hot dog is considered a sandwich, along with demographic and academic details of the respondents.

# Data Dictionary

| Column               | Description                                                                                 | Potential Responses                                                                          |
|-----------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `Timestamp`          | Indicates the month/day/year and hour, minute, and second that the responder completed the survey. | Format: `month/day/year, hour:minute:second`                                               |
| `Sandwich`           | Answers the question: Is a hot dog a sandwich?                                              | `"Yes"`: Respondent believes it is a sandwich, `"No"`: Respondent believes it is not.       |
| `Reasoning`          | Indicates why they chose if a hot dog is a sandwich.                                        | Any length string description of the reasoning.                                             |
| `Enrolled at UVA`    | Indicates if the responder is enrolled at UVA.                                              | `"Yes"`: They are enrolled, `"No"`: They are not.                                           |
| `Major at UVA`       | Answers what the responder's current major is, if applicable.                               | Any string for the major, or empty if not applicable.                                       |
| `Year at UVA`        | Indicates the current year of study at UVA (for undergraduate respondents).                 | `First`, `Second`, `Third`, `Fourth`, or empty for not applicable.                         |
| `Location of birth`  | Indicates where the responder was born.                                                     | Any location (state or country).                                                           |
